# NAME: Facebook · Kiki Stable
# AUTHOR: kiki
# UPDATED: 2026-11-12
# FORMAT: Loon remote rules; choose the outbound policy when subscribing.
# SCOPE: Facebook + Facebook Messenger (including Photos, Videos, Reels, and login).
# POLICY: Keep API, media CDN, and chat on one stable proxy policy when diagnosing slow loading.
# NOTE: This is a ROUTING list, not an ad blocker. It cannot guarantee app-side speed.
# SOURCES: Moli-X, Repcz, v2fly/domain-list-community, MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat (2026-11-12).
# Deliberately exclude broad Facebook/Meta ASN and old fixed IP ranges; see Facebook.README.md.

# Facebook website, Graph API, auth, app services and static resources.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.me

# Media/photo/video CDN: scontent, video, static, Reels, attachment downloads.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbcdn.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbcdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbsbx.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbsbx.net
DOMAIN,fbcdn-a.akamaihd.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.com.edgesuite.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.com.edgekey.net

# Facebook internal networking/edge and share/deep links.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tfbnw.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.watch
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbwat.ch
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.gg
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fburl.com

# Messenger (Facebook-integrated chat).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,messenger.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbmessenger.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,m.me

# Cross-service Meta account and Facebook business/auth links.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebookmail.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebookbrand.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebooklive.com

# Intentionally not included: instagram.com, cdninstagram.com, whatsapp.com,
# whatsapp.net, threads.net, oculus.com, IP-ASN 32934, DOMAIN-KEYWORD,facebook.
# If you already use separate Instagram / WhatsApp rules, this avoids stealing their traffic.
